WEBVTT

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:34.140
Then it was a joke!?

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:38.450
You said you loved me as
a joke!? That's too much!

00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:52.010
B-But...

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:54.960
Does that mean I wasn't
dancing around naked...?

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:05.960
Ever since then, Kyoko
won't say a word to me.

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:28.660
So you're fighting?

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:30.760
With whom?

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:32.520
You and...

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:47.130
I-I'm heading off.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:49.410
See you later!

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:04.570
That's how my husband is...

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:21.640
On this beautiful clear day,
I'm feeling blue.

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:34.110
Poor guy. Why don't
you make up with him?

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:35.950
What do you mean?

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.940
Don't play dumb.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.640
When you see Godai,
you usually go like...

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:42.920
''Oh, Godai
leaving already! ?''

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:45.580
''Part-time work?
How industrious! ''

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:47.850
''See you after work! ''

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.080
I-I don't really...

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.230
You're mad 'cause...

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:57.980
- - he got drunk and yelled...
- - KYOKO! I LOVE YOU!

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.110
That's the cause, right?

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:04.320
I'm so sorry for
all the noise.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.260
No need to apologize!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.730
But why are you giving
him the cold shoulder?

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.490
Why?

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:14.170
Quit complaining,
and enjoy it!

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:17.560
If it was me
I'd be swept aw!ay!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.290
Listen to you!

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.290
I'm so terrible
aren't I?

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.550
So what's the problem?

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:27.920
I...

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:29.680
''I '' what?

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:30.790
B-Because...

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:34.680
It's not your late husband
that's stopping you, is it?

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:45.040
That's certainly
no way to live.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.530
Exactly!
It's unhealthy!

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:50.920
You're still so young.
You shouldn't waste your life.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.270
R-Really, everyone...

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:57.170
I've got it!
How about some tennis?

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:02.670
Honestly, locked up in this old
apartment, you're wasting away!

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.350
You should get out
and have some fun!

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.290
Coming, Mrs. Ichinose?

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:08.370
Who, me?

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:10.740
Wait 'til you
see the coach...

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:14.020
...he's definitely
Something Else!

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:18.170
Okay, then we'll expect
to see you on Sunday.

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:19.900
We'll see you later.

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:24.750
Tennis, huh... ?

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:02.360
Who is that?

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.150
I told you about her!

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.530
The famous
''I love you '' widow?

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:07.980
That's the one!

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:09.790
She looks too good
in that outfit.

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:11.790
She's so young.
How can we compete?

00:06:12.110 --> 00:06:14.020
Score one for youth.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.080
And here we are.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:22.210
- - It's up to you now.
- - Okay.

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:40.230
I hope I don't make too big
a fool of myself.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:43.360
You'll be fine. The
coach is a sweetheart.

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:45.860
You sure don't look
very athletic.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:48.810
Us klutzes gotta
stick together, right?

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:51.290
You must be new students.

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:55.730
I'm Coach Mitaka.

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:02.800
Pleased to meet you!

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:08.190
I love his white teeth!

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:10.730
No fillings at all.
Just a natural sparkle.

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:14.110
First, let's have a little test.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:15.860
We have to take tests?

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:19.590
It's an aptitude test to see if
you'll be in class A, B or C.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:22.050
We'll start with you, ma'am.

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:29.460
You hear that?
He called me ''ma'am ''!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.930
It's a simple test. Just
try to return the serve.

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:43.440
Okay!
Fire when ready.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.300
O-Okay, let's start!

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:46.880
Here!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.740
If it isn't Godai!

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:04.590
part-time work?
Good going.

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:05.940
Yeah, thanks.

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:07.610
Look! Kyoko's up!

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.790
K-Kyoko...

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:25.980
Okay, let's begin!

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:26.770
Ready!

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:45.480
She's pretty good!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.140
You ain't kiddin'.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.870
Okay, let's try it
one more time!

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:23.360
D-Did you see that?
Lace trimming!

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:25.080
I did.
I did. I did.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:26.840
Nice view.

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:29.720
K-Kyoko...

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:32.630
That's enough. You're
definitely in the ''A'' class.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:35.110
Thank you very much!

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:38.950
Who the heck is he?!

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:41.220
You sure put one over on me.

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.750
Actin' so nervous...

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:46.900
''I hope I don't make too
big a fool of myself. ''

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:50.730
Whatever, but would you please
stop trying to imitate me!

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:53.480
I'm just class C.
We're worlds apart.

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:57.220
Well, I was on my high
school tennis team.

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:00.480
But it's been ages,
and I was...

00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:01.500
Actually...

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:03.700
...you've got a
natural talent.

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:07.680
But your form could
use a little help.

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:09.850
Try this...

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:11.350
...and this.

00:10:13.390 --> 00:10:15.800
Remember, your
hips are the key.

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:18.730
Who the heck is he?!

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:21.780
Isn't he that
ladykiller coach?

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:24.990
My wife talks
about nothing else!

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:27.960
And she's past fifty,
don'tcha know.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.360
Ladykiller?

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.580
No, Kyoko!

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:34.700
Get away, Kyoko!
Escape!

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:36.160
See?

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:40.150
Why are you
smiling at him, Kyoko?

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:42.440
Kyoko!

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.320
Kyoko!

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:47.530
Hey, Godai!

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:49.390
Go away!

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:50.890
Godai, you...

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:53.550
W-What is it?
Leave me alone!

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.720
Your block of ice has melted!

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:07.480
Chalk it up to
experience, kid.

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:19.800
Damn!

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:24.210
Now I gotta look
For a new job.

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:29.510
Boy, I'm bushed!

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:32.570
But it's nice to work
up a sweat, Isn't it?

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:35.120
I feel like I sweated
all my stress away.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:38.230
And then there's that
good lookin' coach, too.

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:43.280
Welcome home.

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:44.340
Hi.

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:45.890
part-time work today?

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:48.080
Yep, I even had
to skip my break.

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:49.650
Good for you!

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:52.530
Out working hard while
we're taking tennis lessons.

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.900
Tennis?
I had no idea.

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:59.490
A student like me's got no time
for luxuries like that.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.610
I'm gonna get some rest.

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.610
They didn't suspect a thing!

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.600
That was pretty scary, huh?

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:17.730
Didja get a look
at those marks?

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:20.610
He must've been jammed
against that fence for hours.

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:22.140
What an idiot!

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:23.270
You said it!

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:51.090
Godai!
A package for you!

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:52.690
'Kay.

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:00.700
A package from home!

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:03.520
I'll leave it here, okay?

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:16.430
Wow, Manager.
Killer outfit.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:19.620
Do you think so?
It's just so hot today!

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:21.710
You're really showin'
off your assets.

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:25.980
D-Do you think so?

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:32.460
A care package from home.
How I envy scholars.

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:34.200
Say, say...

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:37.600
Don't you think the
manager's actin' weird?

00:13:40.890 --> 00:13:43.710
Young Godai, permission
to share the wealth.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:50.610
Canned crab and
canned salmon!

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:52.460
Exquisite!

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:57.010
The manager's usually too
classy for that kind of getup.

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:01.310
Summer malaise is upon us,
yet she goes to extremes.

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:04.520
Heat alone is
insufficient explanation.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:06.260
She's got herself a man.

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:08.800
H-Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:10.760
Th-Th-That's my...

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:12.940
...care package?

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:36.390
So that's the
manager's boyfriend!

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.980
Nobody said he's
her boyfriend.

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:41.570
Don't they make
a fine couple?

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.100
I'd never trust a man whose
teeth sparkle like that.

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:46.510
I believe he has
a certain style.

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:49.010
Tennis is hardly
what I'd call ''manly. ''

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:51.940
On the contrary. I'm sure he
does quite well for himself.

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:54.090
A young collegiate like
yourself can't hope to compare.

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:57.740
And you steal care packages
from this ''young collegiate''!

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:00.400
Whatever is the matter?
Did I misspeak?

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:03.480
Don't you have
anything better to do?

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:06.000
We're observing
the manager's boyfriend.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:07.650
Oh, the coach!

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:09.360
Don't jump to conclusions!

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:13.020
- - He's a hunk.
- - Indubitably.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:16.280
I admire you.
You're so full of life.

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:19.610
Really? No one's ever
said that to me before.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:22.860
You've really
perked up lately.

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:24.000
I have?

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.400
Sure, before, it was like
life was passing you by.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:29.180
Like you'd crawled
into a shell or something.

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:40.990
It's your turn, ma'am!

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:44.300
Have fun!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:45.820
I sure will!

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:52.620
Maybe now I can be the way
I was when I first met Soichiro.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.110
Hey!

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:17.050
Why did you have to
scare me like that?

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:20.250
You've got a real
cute little figure!

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:22.150
ls that so.

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:27.400
Come on, get yourself dressed
and ask the coach to join us.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:30.960
Join us for what?

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:33.730
We can all go
hit a coffee shop.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:36.360
A coffee shop?
My pleasure.

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:38.000
What a privilege.

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:40.240
How kind of you
to invite me out.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:42.360
It's actually...

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:45.870
Observe how naturally
he grasps her hand.

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:47.940
Years of practice.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:51.980
It's actually a group outing.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:54.310
One big happy family.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:56.460
No! Count me out!

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:59.430
Oh, no. You mean the
other ladies weren't...

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:03.450
...coming. In truth, we
were the intended parties.

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:08.540
Meet the tenants of
my apartment building.

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:12.030
Come Godai, this display
doesn't become you.

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:16.510
How do you do?
I'm Mitaka.

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:17.630
I'm Yotsuya!

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:18.680
I'm Godai.

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:31.290
A fine vehicle.
Secondhand?

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.280
I bought it new.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:36.370
Must've cost you a bundle!

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:38.670
Not really. It's not
an import, after all.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:41.180
it didn't cost more
than 3.6 million yen.

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:45.950
Work a few years, and you
could afford a nice bicycle.

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:55.900
Chachamaru

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:11.700
What's wrong?

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.240
We're here!

00:18:13.510 --> 00:18:15.090
What's the occasion?

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.870
Introducing the
infamous ladykiller!

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:22.080
Don't you think that's
overdoing it a little?

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:24.650
Kill me now!

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:25.660
H-Hey...

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:32.430
Beer okay for everybody?

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:35.580
Lemonade for me.
I'm driving.

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:37.710
I'll have the same.

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.100
Then, me too.

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:42.660
How come? You don't
even have a bike!

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.790
I don't feel like drinking!

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.850
Don't be that way!

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:51.390
C'mon, chug some liquid
courage and say it again!

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:52.390
Here!

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:53.860
Say what again?

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:55.800
You know...IT!
Don'tcha remember?

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:57.200
M-Mrs. Ichinose!

00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:00.740
''KYOKO, I LOVE YOU! ''

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:18.490
Oh no, Mrs. Ichinose!
That was just a joke!

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:20.360
Think so?

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:21.750
Isn't that right, Godai?

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.770
it was no joke.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:28.700
I love you!

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:38.820
He said it!

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.180
Yeah, but who was
he looking at?

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:42.770
Well done, Godai!

00:19:43.270 --> 00:19:44.760
You can do it!

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:49.550
Manager, don't it
make you happy? Huh!?

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:52.610
S-Stop laughing!
It's not a joke!

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:55.700
What's so funny?

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:56.890
I'm leaving!

00:19:58.940 --> 00:19:59.820
L-Look out!

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:16.160
Kyoko!

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:17.610
Ms. Otonashi!

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:22.490
Young Godai,
take your seat!

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:24.390
Drink up!

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:25.390
Don't wanna!

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:29.150
You declared
your love, sober!

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:30.170
Let's celebrate!

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:31.700
Let me go!

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:34.850
Allow the coach
his turn on the attack.

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:37.700
Whose side are you on?

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:41.150
- - Neither ally nor enemy.
- - Just keepin' things lively.

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:43.450
- - No! Let me go!
- - I'll leave the beer here.

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:45.940
- - That's okay!
- - Now I'm getting mad!

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:49.500
God, that guy was cute!

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:55.470
Ms. Otonashi!

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:01.800
I'm sorry.
It wasn't on purpose.

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:06.130
I-I know that.
It was my fault.

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:09.080
it was just an
unfortunate accident.

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:11.620
No, a fortunate accident!

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:16.830
They're quite
interesting people.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:19.110
They're not bad people.

00:21:20.030 --> 00:21:23.150
They just enjoy seeing
people get upset.

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:26.940
So what was it
that upset you?

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:31.830
Is it so upsetting to hear
someone say he loves you?

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:40.490
If it's so bad...

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:45.470
I'm...a widow.

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:49.930
Then your husband is...

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:52.360
l never want to forget him.

00:21:53.390 --> 00:21:55.240
If I were ever
to forget Soichiro...

00:21:56.060 --> 00:21:58.860
...then he would
truly be dead.

00:22:19.760 --> 00:22:22.040
it seems like this
might take some time.

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:26.940
But I'm a patient man.

00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:34.330
I'll see you on
the tennis court.

00:22:35.100 --> 00:22:35.740
Bye.

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:05.610
Lemme go!

00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:06.850
Don't try to run!

00:23:25.820 --> 00:23:26.710
Kyo...

00:23:27.490 --> 00:23:28.710
Kyoko...

00:23:48.510 --> 00:23:53.050
Poor Kentaro! Nobody'll take him
anywhere for summer vacation!

